{#
  =============================================================================
  PARTIAL: CTA Flag Badge
  =============================================================================
  Included from block--bundle--call-to-action.html.twig at one of two anchors:

    1. Inside figure.cta-media when the card has media — the normal case.
       Measured 2026-09-04: all 49 flag-on CTA blocks have an image. Anchoring
       here is what makes 'middle' and 'bottom' mean middle/bottom OF THE IMAGE
       rather than of the whole card. The card also holds the title, body and
       button footer, so a card-anchored 'bottom' would land the flag under the
       button, nowhere near the image.

    2. Directly in the card when there is no media, because there is no image
       to anchor to. Position still applies, measured against the card.

  This lives in its own file rather than being pasted at both call sites. The
  template carries a standing warning never to split the wrapper divs across
  conditionals; two hand-maintained copies would be that same hazard in slower
  motion.

  Expects from context: flag_pos, flag_side, flag_trans, flag_background, icon,
  icon_size, icon_color, flag_title.
  =============================================================================
#}
<div class="cta-flag-anchor cta-flag--{{ flag_pos }} cta-flag--{{ flag_side }}
            position-absolute {{ flag_side == 'right' ? 'end-0' : 'start-0' }} z-1">
  {%- set flag_classes = [
    'flag-badge',
    'd-inline-flex',
    'align-items-center',
    'py-1',
    'px-2',
    flag_trans ? 'flag--trans' : null,
    flag_trans ? 'flag--trans-' ~ flag_trans : null,
  ]|filter(v => v) -%}
  <div class="flag py-2 {{ flag_background }} {{ flag_classes|join(' ')|trim }}"
       style="width:max-content;white-space:nowrap;">
    {%- if icon -%}
      <i class="{{ icon }} {{ icon_size }} px-1"
         {% if icon_color %}style="color:{{ icon_color }}"{% endif %}
         aria-hidden="true"></i>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if flag_title -%}
      <span class="flag-title">{{- flag_title -}}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>
